<title>BRAZIL: Banco do Brasil nets 25.9 mln reais in Nov.</title>
<headline>Banco do Brasil nets 25.9 mln reais in Nov.</headline>
<text>
<p>SAO PAULO, Dec 23 Reuter) - Brazil's government bank Banco Brasil said it reported a net profit of 25.905 million reais or 0.04 real per lot of 1,000 shares for the month of November.</p>
<p>In the July-November period, the bank's net profit totals 184.692 million reais, it said in a statement sent to Brazil's Securities and Exchange Commission (CVM) and the stock exchanges.</p>
<p>In 1995, the bank posted a 4.2 billion real loss.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 55-11-2485412))</p>
